This project follows a tutorial.
================================

Everything here is built from the "Optical Character Recognition (OCR)" chapter
of "500 Lines or Less" by Marina Samuel:

    https://aosabook.org/en/500L/optical-character-recognition-ocr.html

The network design, the training loop, the client/server split, and the
hidden-node experiment are all taken from that chapter. The reference
implementation lives at:

    https://github.com/aosabook/500lines/tree/master/ocr

"500 Lines or Less" licenses its software and its written material separately,
and both apply here.


